    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ammunition creates clutching brambles around the target. The creature you hit takes extra Slashing damage equal to one roll of your Arcane Shot Die and must succeed on a Strength saving throw or have the Restrained condition for 1 minute or until you use this option again. The target, or a creature within its reach, can take an action to make a Strength (Athletics) check against your Arcane Shot save DC, removing the brambles on a success.</p>",
